text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_EveryTypeStrongerThanOthers {
    "The types of POKéMON match up\n"
    "differently with each other.\p"
    "Every type is stronger than some\n"
    "types and weaker than others.$"
}

text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_NuggetUselessSoldFor5000 {
    "A NUGGET is totally useless.\n"
    "So I sold it for ¥5000.$"
}

text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_HeardGhostsHauntLavender {
    "I heard that ghosts haunt\n"
    "LAVENDER TOWN.$"
}

text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GiveEverstoneIfCaught20Mons {
    "Oh… {PLAYER}!\n"
    "I've been looking for you!\p"
    "It's me, one of the ever-present\n"
    "AIDES to PROF. OAK.\p"
    "If your POKéDEX has complete data\n"
    "on twenty species, I'm supposed to\l"
    "give you a reward from PROF. OAK.\p"
    "He entrusted me with this\n"
    "EVERSTONE.\p"
    "So, {PLAYER}, let me ask you.\p"
    "Have you gathered data on at least\n"
    "twenty kinds of POKéMON?$"
}

text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_GreatHereYouGo {
    "Great! You have caught or owned\n"
    "{STR_VAR_3} kinds of POKéMON!\p"
    "Congratulations!\n"
    "Here you go!$"
}

text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ReceivedEverstoneFromAide {
    "{PLAYER} received the EVERSTONE\n"
    "from the AIDE.$"
}

text Route10_PokemonCenter_1F_Text_ExplainEverstone {
    "Making POKéMON evolve certainly\n"
    "can add to the POKéDEX.\p"
    "However, at times, you may not\n"
    "want a certain POKéMON to evolve.\p"
    "In that case, give the EVERSTONE\n"
    "to that POKéMON.\p"
    "It will prevent evolution according\n"
    "to the PROFESSOR.$"
}
